
>> animal := Walax cusub. 
 
 animal marka: ['name:'] samee: { :n
iska-leh magac := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal marka: ['magac'] samee: { <- magac.
}.

>> cat := animal cusub.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat marka: ['magac'] samee: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (naf magac).
}.

Soo-saar qor: cat magac.
